    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Poly Plaza?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poly Plaza</strong> is an open-world sandbox game where you get to buy properties, collect rent, and become the richest man in town!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy properties</strong>: From cozy little houses to awesome supermarkets, find and buy the coolest properties!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect rent</strong>: Watch your money grow as you collect rent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purchase cars</strong>: To explore the open world with ease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect resources</strong>: In <strong>Poly Plaza</strong> each resource can be collected and sold, but be aware not every NPC will purchase what you have to sell and not all of them will give you the same price!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Poly Plaza?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poly Plaza</strong> is an open-world sandbox game where you get to buy properties, collect rent, and become the richest man in town!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy properties</strong>: From cozy little houses to awesome supermarkets, find and buy the coolest properties!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect rent</strong>: Watch your money grow as you collect rent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purchase cars</strong>: To explore the open world with ease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect resources</strong>: In <strong>Poly Plaza</strong> each resource can be collected and sold, but be aware not every NPC will purchase what you have to sell and not all of them will give you the same price!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "An open-world entrepreneurial sandbox game. Sell resources, purchase properties, become rich.",
